flowchart TD
  U[React: submit text and explicit sample date] --> API[FastAPI: persist Case and launch graph]
  API --> REQ[W1 Requirements: extract and validate]
  REQ --> FIELD{All required fields present?}
  FIELD -->|No| MAX{Clarification limit reached?}
  MAX -->|Yes| HUMAN[HUMAN_REVIEW and audit]
  MAX -->|No| Q[Persist question and audit]
  Q --> WAITQ[Interrupt: wait for answer]
  WAITQ -->|POST answers + resume| REQ
  FIELD -->|Yes| CAT[Tool: create immutable synthetic offer snapshots]
  CAT --> ANY{Any valid candidates?}
  ANY -->|No| HUMAN
  ANY -->|Yes| PRE[W3 Comparison: preliminary ranking]
  PRE --> EV[W2 Evidence: verify selected candidate]
  EV --> SUP[Manager: evidence-based arbitration]
  SUP --> PASS{Selected offer PASS all hard constraints?}
  PASS -->|Yes| FINAL[Verified final recommendation]
  PASS -->|No| LIMIT{Another candidate and rerank_count below 1?}
  LIMIT -->|No| HUMAN
  LIMIT -->|Yes| EXCL[Persist exclusions and MANAGER_RERANK audit]
  EXCL --> RR[W3 Comparison: select next eligible offer]
  RR --> EV
  FINAL --> PREP[Idempotently create PENDING approval in PostgreSQL]
  PREP --> WAITA[Interrupt: wait for user decision, no side effects]
  WAITA -->|POST decision and resume| D{Durable PG approval decision?}
  D -->|REJECTED| REJECT[REJECTED and audit]
  D -->|Invalid, expired or stale| HUMAN
  D -->|APPROVED| BOOK[W4 Booking: validate and upsert mock order]
  BOOK --> EXISTS{Committed order read-back verified?}
  EXISTS -->|No| HUMAN
  EXISTS -->|Yes| REVIEW[W5 Review: structured summary and audit]
  REVIEW --> DONE[Case DEMO_COMPLETED]
  API -.-> PG[(PostgreSQL business data)]
  SUP -.-> PG
  BOOK -.-> PG
  REQ -.-> CP[(LangGraph AsyncPostgresSaver)]
